    {
      "id": "sample-004",
      "kind": "model_review",
      "split": "development",
      "group": "SoundBlaster/SessionMonitor#145",
      "used_for_tuning": true,
      "case": {
        "id": "case-004",
        "repository": "SoundBlaster/SessionMonitor",
        "pr": 145,
        "base": "3eaa86281b9e3874176ebc980178f07457a2d7c1",
        "head": "8097a8b98a8691e85fb2441d4016b9b926320a52",
        "checks": [
          {
            "id": "check-001",
            "kind": "source",
            "side": "after",
            "path": "Sources/MonitorStore/QuotaProjectionRead.swift"
          },
          {
            "id": "check-002",
            "kind": "relation_exact",
            "side": "before",
            "relation_kind": "calls",
            "from_any": [
              "SessionMonitor.agentStatus",
              "agentStatus"
            ],
            "to_any": [
              "snapshot",
              "self.snapshot",
              "SessionMonitor.snapshot"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "check-003",
            "kind": "relation_absence",
            "side": "before",
            "relation_kind": "calls",
            "from_contains": [
              "SessionMonitor",
              "agentStatus"
            ],
            "to_contains": [
              "UsageStore",
              "snapshot"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "check-004",
            "kind": "relation_exact",
            "side": "before",
            "relation_kind": "calls",
            "from_any": [
              "SessionMonitor.agentStatus",
              "agentStatus"
            ],
            "to_any": [
              "UsageStore.latestSessionID",
              "store.latestSessionID"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "rubric": [
          "Each calls row names one immediate caller and one callee; never merge snapshot and latestSessionID into one endpoint.",
          "Before AgentStatus.swift invokes store.latestSessionID and an unqualified snapshot(query:). QueryObservation.swift is NOT supplied: retain that literal target or self.snapshot, not an invented direct call to UsageStore.snapshot.",
          "Explain why reduced quota input preserves relevant decisions: all latest timestamp ties and reset-transition witnesses, with full coverage tracked separately. Ordered LIMIT 1 selections and 256/1024 batching are not an arbitrary overall row cap; do not claim constant total database work.",
          "Migration registration and initialization are supplied in UsageStore.swift; acknowledge that wiring rather than declaring it missing. Distinguish unknown external writers and unobserved runs.",
          "Describe only source-supported policy reuse, not complete semantic equivalence or benchmark speedups; performance documentation was omitted."
        ]
      },
      "fixture": null,
      "records": [
        "35e182f6f5f0c9aba70834fb481be6e0671401f790e5a5bbcfbd2f550167bb35",
        "384f61e5e97173c51c82c6c0a4f260479f5e6e484a1936890b3d2e3b640a69ef"
      ],
      "adjudication": {
        "status": "source_checked",
        "assessor_kind": "agent",
        "rationale": "Source-checked false direct call: an unqualified snapshot helper does not establish a direct UsageStore.snapshot call; retain atomic endpoints and explain selection witnesses/coverage."
      },
      "tags": [
        "wrapper_shortcut",
        "compound_endpoint",
        "reduced_input"
      ],
      "origin_urls": [
        "https://github.com/SoundBlaster/SessionMonitor/pull/145"
      ]
